  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0GW1">Definition <span data-tag="0GW1">101.48.1</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{X}$ be an algebraic stack. We say $\mathcal{X}$ is <em>decent</em> if for every $x \in |\mathcal{X}|$ the equivalent conditions of Properties of Stacks, Lemma <a href="/tag/0DTK" data-tag="0DTK">100.14.1</a> are satisfied. </p>
